      "name": "project_supplier_contacts",
      "description": {
        "content": "Use the project supplier contacts API to manage project suppliers. This API provides 2 advantages over the project supplier companies APIs:\n- It allows specifying the supplier contact to be associated/removed from a project.\n- It allows specifying multiple contacts for a given supplier.\n",
